    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult puzzles with simple rules!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>3D Puzzle with simple rules!</u> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple: just complete a cube made of 27 cubes within the time limit!\u3000However, please try not to rearrange the cubes once they have been placed. If you solve the puzzle without repositioning them, you can achieve a special clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A completely random puzzle every time.</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you wanted to play a puzzle, a random puzzle would be created. There are incredibly many types of puzzles, and the probability of you playing the same puzzle twice is very low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Tutorial and special treats</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared a tutorial to help you understand how to operate the game.\u3000Additionally, to enhance your enjoyment of the game, we have prepared a little reward for you.\u3000You can earn rewards by solving a lot of puzzles, solving them multiple times in a short time, or solving them consecutively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Finally,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be a rather difficult puzzle game contrary to its appearance.\u3000If you are confident in solving puzzles, want to improve your spatial awareness, or just want to pass the time on your computer, please challenge yourself with this puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for 100 consecutive clears!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult puzzles with simple rules!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>3D Puzzle with simple rules!</u> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple: just complete a cube made of 27 cubes within the time limit!\u3000However, please try not to rearrange the cubes once they have been placed. If you solve the puzzle without repositioning them, you can achieve a special clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A completely random puzzle every time.</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you wanted to play a puzzle, a random puzzle would be created. There are incredibly many types of puzzles, and the probability of you playing the same puzzle twice is very low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Tutorial and special treats</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared a tutorial to help you understand how to operate the game.\u3000Additionally, to enhance your enjoyment of the game, we have prepared a little reward for you.\u3000You can earn rewards by solving a lot of puzzles, solving them multiple times in a short time, or solving them consecutively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Finally,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be a rather difficult puzzle game contrary to its appearance.\u3000If you are confident in solving puzzles, want to improve your spatial awareness, or just want to pass the time on your computer, please challenge yourself with this puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for 100 consecutive clears!</p>",
    "short_description": "Train your brain with 3D puzzles! You won't be able to say, &quot;I've already solved all the puzzles in this game...&quot;! You can solve a new puzzle every time, completely randomly. There are countless types of puzzles!",
